{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What if Mahjong is 2D?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1, 2, and 3 circle make a straight, and 3, 4, and 5 circle make a straight. Wouldn't it be nice if that 3 circle could be used more than once?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967760/extras/ee1adef40ce8a47826937dc8e134c900.poster.avif?t=1761717203\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967760/extras/ee1adef40ce8a47826937dc8e134c900.webm?t=1761717203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A crisscrossing mahjong grid, stacking patterns</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Matrix Mahjong</i>, flexibly arrange your tiles on the 3x7 table to achieve HU (a winning hand) in diverse ways, and multiply your earnings with a variety of FAN (scoring rules).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exquisite pixel mahjong and smooth drag-and-drop interaction create an immersive tile-building experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967760/extras/2025-10-17-20-34-24?t=1761717203\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3967760?t=1761717203","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967760/578fafb36f157624c9c5f6f8c0e45d61b8018479/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761717203","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967760/17ffa79e12020ae10c4e13800b17656869625da5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761717203","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967760/17ffa79e12020ae10c4e13800b17656869625da5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761717203","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What if Mahjong is 2D?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1, 2, and 3 circle make a straight, and 3, 4, and 5 circle make a straight. Wouldn't it be nice if that 3 circle could be used more than once?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967760/extras/ee1adef40ce8a47826937dc8e134c900.poster.avif?t=1761717203\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967760/extras/ee1adef40ce8a47826937dc8e134c900.webm?t=1761717203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A crisscrossing mahjong grid, stacking patterns</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Matrix Mahjong</i>, flexibly arrange your tiles on the 3x7 table to achieve HU (a winning hand) in diverse ways, and multiply your earnings with a variety of FAN (scoring rules).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exquisite pixel mahjong and smooth drag-and-drop interaction create an immersive tile-building experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967760/extras/2025-10-17-20-34-24?t=1761717203\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["CHAO8"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967760/4b39dd047a7a26b5d0166bfc61b63060841dbc41/header.jpg?t=1761717203","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"\u7eb5\u6a2a\u9ebb\u5c06 Matrix Mahjong","pac